  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/PSlayer.PNG\" title=\"Princess Slayer57\"><img alt=\"Princess Slayer57\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/PSlayer.PNG\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/PSlayer.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Princess Slayer57</div></div></div>\n<p><br/>\nPrincess Slayer57 is a <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Shadow Mutant Hulk\">Shadow Mutant Hulk</a> Champion and is the last Sitar Hero in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sitar_Hero_-_Face_Off\" title=\"Sitar Hero - Face Off\">Sitar Hero - Face Off</a> quest. He is found on <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a> Level 7.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
